{"id":"ab85279fd837dade","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-merkle-gap.md","title":"Merkle低初段复杂度间隙","display":"thm-merkle-gap — Merkle低初段复杂度间隙","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-merkle-gap","aliases":["43-thm-merkle-gap"],"display":"thm-merkle-gap — Merkle低初段复杂度间隙","depends_on":["[[43-df-order-function]]","[[43-df-condplainkolm]]","[[43-df-comprandom]]","[[43-df-partial-computable-random]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_location":"Theorem 12.2.1 (Merkle), both parts","source_printed_pages":"328–329","source_pdf_pages":"348–349","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16-round3"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-merkle-gap"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-merkle-gap</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-merkle-gap — Merkle低初段复杂度间隙"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9919dea7144eefd8\" href=\"?note=9919dea7144eefd8\" title=\"43-df-order-function\">43-df-order-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e79ea45002ccf795\" href=\"?note=e79ea45002ccf795\" title=\"43-df-condplainkolm\">43-df-condplainkolm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"52fd5856a06d2543\" href=\"?note=52fd5856a06d2543\" title=\"43-df-comprandom\">43-df-comprandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a0abc398f6f3118e\" href=\"?note=a0abc398f6f3118e\" title=\"43-df-partial-computable-random\">43-df-partial-computable-random</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 12.2.1 (Merkle), both parts"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"328–329"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"348–349"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16-round3"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C(\\sigma\\mid n)\">\\(C(\\sigma\\mid n)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Order}\">\\(\\operatorname{Order}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PartialComputableRandom}\">\\(\\operatorname{PartialComputableRandom}\\)</span> 分别采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e79ea45002ccf795\" href=\"?note=e79ea45002ccf795\" title=\"43-df-condplainkolm\">43-df-condplainkolm</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9919dea7144eefd8\" href=\"?note=9919dea7144eefd8\" title=\"43-df-order-function\">43-df-order-function</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"52fd5856a06d2543\" href=\"?note=52fd5856a06d2543\" title=\"43-df-comprandom\">43-df-comprandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a0abc398f6f3118e\" href=\"?note=a0abc398f6f3118e\" title=\"43-df-partial-computable-random\">43-df-partial-computable-random</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\log_2\">\\(\\log_2\\)</span> 为二进制对数。所有阶函数的量化域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists X\\in2^\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}(X)\\land\\forall f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;(\\operatorname{Order}(f)\\Rightarrow\\exists N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:j\\ge N\\}\\;C(X\\upharpoonright n\\mid n)\\le f(n))\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists X\\in2^\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}(X)\\land\\forall f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;(\\operatorname{Order}(f)\\Rightarrow\\exists N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:j\\ge N\\}\\;C(X\\upharpoonright n\\mid n)\\le f(n))\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists Y\\in2^\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{PartialComputableRandom}(Y)\\land\\forall f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;(\\operatorname{Order}(f)\\Rightarrow\\exists N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:j\\ge\\max\\{N,2\\}\\}\\;C(Y\\upharpoonright n\\mid n)\\le f(n)\\log_2 n)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists Y\\in2^\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{PartialComputableRandom}(Y)\\land\\forall f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;(\\operatorname{Order}(f)\\Rightarrow\\exists N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:j\\ge\\max\\{N,2\\}\\}\\;C(Y\\upharpoonright n\\mid n)\\le f(n)\\log_2 n)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>X、Y先于所有可计算阶选择，阈值N可以依赖阶。不能交换存在序列与全称阶的量词。第二式保留log因子并避开log 0；没有把草稿随后陈述的选择随机性分离误当成同一个结论。核对两部分陈述，未独立重证Merkle构造。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所供2007-07-28草稿，Theorem 12.2.1 (Merkle), both parts；印刷页328–329，PDF页348–349。本轮逐项核对来源陈述；未将来源完整证明标记为已核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-order-function","status":"resolved","id":"9919dea7